==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|normalities}}

# The state of being [[normal]] or [[usual]]; [[normalcy]].
#:''Jessie was going to wear pants to school, but her brother persuaded her to wear shorts to preserve '''normality'''.''
# {{chemistry}} The [[concentration]] of a [[solution]] expressed in [[gram equivalent weight]]s of [[solute]] per [[litre]] of [[solution]].
# {{mathematics}} A [[measure]] of how well an observed [[distribution]] approximates a [[normal distribution]].

